<title>INDIA: India CARE rates HUDCO's 2.5 bln rupee bonds 'AA'.</title>
<headline>India CARE rates HUDCO's 2.5 bln rupee bonds 'AA'.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Credit Analysis &amp; Research Ltd (CARE) on Thursday said it assigned a CARE AA rating for Housing and Urban Development Corp Ltd's (HUDCO) 2.5 billion rupee bond issue.</p>
<p>It said the CARE AA rating denotes 'high quality investment grade'.  </p>
<p>The state-run HUDCO is a leading housing finance firm.</p>
<p>CARE said it assigned a CARE AAA rating, denoting 'best quality investment grade', for Industrial Development Bank of India's (IDBI) 1.5 billion rupee capital gains bonds/deposit issue.</p>
<p>IDBI is India's leading term lending bank.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
